  "content": "请提供需要翻译的文本。<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通用附魔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通过让附魔适用于更多物品、移除多余兼容限制，并改进多个原版附魔，扩展了 Minecraft 的附魔系统。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凭什么只有剑能享受快乐？将</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">加到三叉戟上🔱，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">加到弩上🏹，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">加到斧头上🪓，或者给动物盔甲加上保护附魔🛡️。这个模组开启了无数新组合，同时保持与原版游戏基调一致。⚔️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了扩展兼容性，部分附魔还获得了实用的质量改进。</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">真正变得无限♾️，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">时运</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">会额外奖励经验💎，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更加有效🎯，等等。每一项变化都可以单独配置⚙️，让你能创造最适合自己世界的附魔系统。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更多武器获得更多附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">斧头、三叉戟、锤、弓、弩、盾牌及其他装备可以附魔之前无法获取的许多现有附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扩展的远程战斗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在弓上使用</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速装填</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，或在弩上使用</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冲击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火矢</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">增强的三叉戟和锤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">向三叉戟和锤应用诸如</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破盾</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">等附魔，创造出强大的新武器组合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔动物盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">马铠、狼铠以及鹦鹉螺壳盔甲可以受益于多种盔甲附魔，包括</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落缓冲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灵魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">荆棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更少的附魔限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">流行的组合如</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">经验修补</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">以及</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">现在默认可以并存。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可选伤害附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">配置</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">与</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破盾</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">一起工作，而非互斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可选保护附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">允许</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">与</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">爆炸保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">弹射物保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在同一件装备上并存。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">改进的原版附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不再需要备用箭矢，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">和</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">时运</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提升经验掉落，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落缓冲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">防止踩踏耕地，</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">得益于移除的弹射物免疫。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每项兼容性变更和附魔调整都可以通过数据包分别启用、禁用或完全自定义。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以使用游戏内模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 上需安装</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">，来自</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有配置文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，根据配置类型命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。并非所有类型都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模组附带了几个可选数据包，用于扩展现有附魔可应用的物品，并开启新的附魔组合。每个数据包专注于特定的物品组或附魔组，可独立控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在创建世界时，可以从</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">数据包</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">界面启用或禁用这些数据包，也可以在现有世界和多人服务器中使用</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">命令。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">详细文档、所有数据包的完整参考以及该模组提供的数据包附加功能信息，可以在 GitHub 上的</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">中找到。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-walls\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
